            },
        },
        --[[
            A blowpipe with a gather still on the end of it, which is the
            one tool in the game that is hot while it is being carried.

            The long rod is the wrong half of the silhouette -- a hammer,
            a ladle and a pair of shears are all a rod at icon scale -- so
            the identity has to be the far end. The gather is a bright
            core skinned over in glass, with a drip hanging off the
            underside, because that is the shape molten glass makes and
            nothing else in the cast glows at the tip.

            It is deliberately not shaped like anything. She spent the
